WEBVTT

00:22.040 --> 00:23.680
<i>ONE MORE TIME</i>

00:23.880 --> 00:28.630
I LOOKED AT THE BLOOMING
FLOWERS IN MY SHINING DREAM

00:28.800 --> 00:32.350
<i>NO MORE LIFE</i>
I WAS OBSESSED

00:32.520 --> 00:35.110
MY PAST WAS SCATTERED

00:35.280 --> 00:38.670
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY THOSE HANDS

00:38.840 --> 00:41.990
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
I WAS CALLED

00:42.160 --> 00:45.310
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY A LIGHT SHINING

00:45.480 --> 00:48.710
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
IN THE DARKNESS

00:48.880 --> 00:52.320
<i>ONE MORE TIME</i>
IN THE TWINKLING LIGHT

00:52.480 --> 00:55.440
WATCH THAT FIGURE FADE AWAY

00:55.600 --> 00:59.230
<i>NO MORE LIFE</i>
I WAS LEFT BEHIND

00:59.400 --> 01:02.150
BUT TOMORROW WE'LL MEET AGAIN

01:02.320 --> 01:05.440
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY THOSE HANDS

01:05.600 --> 01:08.750
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
I WAS CALLED

01:08.920 --> 01:12.150
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY A LIGHT SHINING

01:12.320 --> 01:15.470
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
IN THE DARKNESS

01:15.640 --> 01:21.400
SURROUNDED BY THE LIGHT

01:21.560 --> 01:23.840
<i>DON'T CLOSE EYES
HELP ME</i>

01:24.000 --> 01:29.330
WHEN I SCREAM
<i>WILL BE SATISFACTION, YOU KNOW</i>

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with
thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various
daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking
to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:09.980
On the fifteenth day of the
ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:09.980 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of
Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi
clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of
Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been three
hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:47.080 --> 02:49.970
URASHIMA AND YASHA

03:10.000 --> 03:12.200
Princess Kaguya!

03:12.760 --> 03:15.230
Is everything okay?

03:18.960 --> 03:20.190
Bats!

03:22.360 --> 03:24.830
Danjo, hurry up.

03:26.800 --> 03:28.840
Forgive me!

03:35.840 --> 03:37.350
I can hardly believe...

03:38.160 --> 03:41.230
that such a big castle has been built...

03:42.320 --> 03:44.150
inside a cave like this.

04:11.400 --> 04:13.070
The artifact is inside.

04:20.200 --> 04:22.840
No sign of ayakashi.

04:23.480 --> 04:26.440
- Let's go.
- Wait a moment!

04:27.200 --> 04:30.110
This wall of light must be a barrier.

04:30.720 --> 04:36.190
Did the Yin-Yang monk put
up this anti-ayakashi barrier?

04:36.720 --> 04:38.600
Urashima, no doubt.

04:43.240 --> 04:45.200
I am the Yin-Yang monk Urashima.

04:45.760 --> 04:47.560
A Yin-Yang monk?

04:47.720 --> 04:50.550
Like the one who hid the artifacts?

04:51.080 --> 04:54.630
If you want to find these
artifacts, I will help you.

05:05.000 --> 05:07.560
Everything is fine.

05:07.720 --> 05:10.310
Urashima, I thank you for your proposal.

05:11.200 --> 05:13.240
Well, let's go.

05:15.960 --> 05:19.870
If this barrier is Urashima's
work, we shouldn't fear it.

05:20.480 --> 05:21.750
Let's move on.

05:23.560 --> 05:28.510
Do you really want to
enter this gloomy castle?

05:35.080 --> 05:38.230
Princess Kaguya!
Sasuke Sarutobi!

05:38.400 --> 05:40.200
Wait for me!

05:40.760 --> 05:42.670
Don't leave me!

05:46.630 --> 05:48.630
SHINOBI

05:47.480 --> 05:48.680
Danjo...

05:49.240 --> 05:50.720
is everything okay?

05:52.480 --> 05:54.070
I'm coming!

06:28.360 --> 06:33.870
Master Musashi, that is a precious
object used to imprison ayakashi!

06:34.320 --> 06:35.750
It is not a toy!

06:36.280 --> 06:37.760
You bet!

06:37.920 --> 06:40.910
If you don't have the seven, it's not good!

06:41.080 --> 06:45.240
For now, it's a worthless stone!

06:45.400 --> 06:46.600
Ronin!

06:49.880 --> 06:51.630
I'm throwing, Musashi!

06:53.080 --> 06:55.830
Master Musashi!
Master Ronin!

06:56.240 --> 06:57.830
You worry too much.

06:58.440 --> 07:00.800
We need to take our minds off things.

07:01.360 --> 07:02.560
Yeah.

07:03.800 --> 07:05.000
Enough!

07:05.800 --> 07:11.510
Ninjataro, you're quite
serious for someone so lame.

07:11.680 --> 07:15.150
You should try to change that.

07:16.640 --> 07:22.590
Yeah. And if you take the time to live,
you'll also progress in ninja art.

07:23.400 --> 07:24.670
Yeah.

07:25.240 --> 07:26.440
Yeah.

07:26.480 --> 07:28.280
That's none of your business.

07:28.960 --> 07:31.520
Desperado, defend me a little!

07:32.480 --> 07:35.360
Yeah, I feel the same way.

07:36.080 --> 07:37.310
Princess Yume!

07:37.840 --> 07:40.350
Yeah, I agree with them.

07:42.080 --> 07:43.780
Even Princess Yume is against me!

07:44.200 --> 07:47.110
I feel that my favorite line is a hit.

07:47.520 --> 07:48.920
I doubt it.

07:49.800 --> 07:51.000
Yeah.

07:51.320 --> 07:53.230
Ronin, catch!

07:54.320 --> 07:56.200
Do you still know how to aim?

07:56.680 --> 07:58.670
Damn, I screwed up!

08:03.560 --> 08:04.760
This is bad!

08:07.640 --> 08:08.840
Stop!

08:31.040 --> 08:32.710
I'm exhausted!

08:32.880 --> 08:35.390
Exhausted to death!

08:36.680 --> 08:38.990
Yasha!
Yasha, are you there?

08:41.960 --> 08:44.430
Did you call for me, Lord Ryogen?

08:45.520 --> 08:51.350
You knew what kind of trap this
castle had and didn't explain it to me!

08:51.920 --> 08:53.960
I got a big scare!

08:54.720 --> 08:59.750
You're the one who refused my explanations.

09:01.880 --> 09:04.600
Is that all you wanted to ask me?

09:06.560 --> 09:07.760
Yes...

09:09.200 --> 09:11.350
In that case, I'll take my leave.

09:13.040 --> 09:17.000
By the way, what happened
to the second artifact?

09:17.880 --> 09:19.470
Musashi has it.

09:20.080 --> 09:22.640
Weren't you supposed to steal it?

09:23.440 --> 09:25.160
I beg your pardon.

09:26.040 --> 09:30.640
I wanted to implement a new strategy.

09:31.080 --> 09:33.550
I am not interested in your excuses!

09:33.720 --> 09:36.600
The artifact must be taken
away from him immediately!

09:39.080 --> 09:40.510
Is there a problem?

09:41.200 --> 09:43.480
No. Please excuse me.

09:47.840 --> 09:49.400
He scared me...

10:09.200 --> 10:11.270
Mr. Leonardo da Vinci.

10:12.080 --> 10:13.750
Yasha, is that you?

10:14.680 --> 10:17.400
I've come to ask for Rasetsu's help.

10:17.920 --> 10:20.910
I just finished doing a check-up.

10:21.080 --> 10:22.750
Use it however you wish.

10:23.680 --> 10:25.000
Thank you.

10:26.200 --> 10:27.630
Yasha...

10:28.440 --> 10:31.190
Do you know the Ying-Yang
monk called Urashima?

10:32.760 --> 10:36.200
From the look on your
face, I guess you do.

10:36.720 --> 10:41.030
While I was examining the
artifact on Rasetsu's body...

10:41.200 --> 10:43.950
he showed up...

10:44.880 --> 10:48.480
in incorporeal form.

10:52.840 --> 10:55.640
What is your relationship with him?

10:58.400 --> 11:01.390
Are you going to pretend you don't know him?

11:01.720 --> 11:04.390
What were Urashima's plans?

11:04.960 --> 11:11.600
He wanted to prevent the seven artifacts
from falling into the hands of the ayakashi.

11:11.760 --> 11:15.880
He also talked about helping
Musashi and his companions.

11:19.280 --> 11:21.510
I'll take Rasetsu.

11:24.880 --> 11:29.000
- Better leave the artifact here.
- Why?

11:29.760 --> 11:33.470
Musashi could take it away from you.

11:33.960 --> 11:36.790
I'll deal with him if it comes to it.

11:42.760 --> 11:46.390
What's that scoundrel Yasha up to?

12:10.560 --> 12:12.230
Princess Kaguya.

12:12.680 --> 12:17.120
This place is quite dangerous.

12:17.320 --> 12:21.880
Don't get too far away from me!

12:26.120 --> 12:28.030
Ghosts!

12:31.680 --> 12:33.430
Help!

12:39.680 --> 12:42.040
Danjo, that's enough!

12:42.640 --> 12:45.110
Look, they're just bats.

12:56.560 --> 12:58.790
Those bats scare me.

12:59.320 --> 13:03.280
Danjo, are you really
protecting Princess Kaguya?

13:03.760 --> 13:07.120
Sasuke Sarutobi, don't be mean to him.

13:07.280 --> 13:09.510
Danjo is very scared.

13:13.120 --> 13:15.110
I feel insulted!

13:15.920 --> 13:19.630
From now on, I'll be the one leading!

13:19.800 --> 13:22.870
Follow me, both of you!

13:27.840 --> 13:29.040
I apologize.

13:29.200 --> 13:31.790
He's also a very prideful man.

13:32.680 --> 13:35.040
You can easily guess his character.

13:44.040 --> 13:45.440
What is this?

13:50.880 --> 13:53.710
Could it be an ayakashi?
No, no, no....

13:54.120 --> 13:57.640
If I get scared, Princess Kaguya
will laugh at me again.

13:57.800 --> 14:02.790
It's probably a gathering of rowdy bats.

14:03.560 --> 14:06.390
Yes, it is!
There is no doubt about it!

14:11.000 --> 14:14.040
I knew it.
It was a bat.

14:14.680 --> 14:16.080
Phew!

14:22.200 --> 14:26.320
Actually, bats of this size do not exist!

14:26.480 --> 14:29.520
Does that mean it's an ayakashi?

14:41.160 --> 14:43.360
A monster!

14:50.320 --> 14:51.990
That was close!

14:52.480 --> 14:55.230
A little more and it would
have gone into the river.

14:55.920 --> 14:58.910
I admire your speed, Ninjataro.

14:59.400 --> 15:00.960
I am a ninja, after all!

15:01.760 --> 15:02.960
I sense danger!

15:05.680 --> 15:07.880
The waves are going against the current!

15:08.840 --> 15:10.990
No sign of ayakashi.

15:11.160 --> 15:13.880
It must be that mechanical puppet.

15:22.400 --> 15:24.790
That big thing is flying!

15:30.760 --> 15:35.400
You won't win this time,
you pile of rotten wood!

15:39.800 --> 15:41.710
Come on!

15:41.880 --> 15:43.840
Ronin, attack from the left!

15:44.320 --> 15:47.280
Got it!
Are you attacking from the top?

15:48.200 --> 15:51.750
Master Musashi, I'll take the right!

16:02.880 --> 16:04.080
Ronin!

16:09.240 --> 16:10.440
Thanks!

16:19.680 --> 16:21.720
Over here, woodpile!

16:24.040 --> 16:25.680
Flammable bullet!

16:39.760 --> 16:40.960
I've got it!

16:49.080 --> 16:50.310
That is mine!

16:51.120 --> 16:52.790
Do your best, Musashi!

16:53.840 --> 16:56.510
Let's help Musashi!

16:57.280 --> 17:00.150
Doing that feels wrong, but okay.

17:00.640 --> 17:03.150
We must get the artifact back!

17:06.800 --> 17:08.070
Take this!

17:12.160 --> 17:13.640
- Yume!
-Yes!

17:20.520 --> 17:21.870
Now, Princess Yume!

17:22.480 --> 17:23.680
Yes!

17:32.760 --> 17:33.960
Right in the face!

17:35.040 --> 17:36.240
Impressive!

17:40.560 --> 17:41.760
Yeah.

17:42.680 --> 17:46.280
My power can only hold the enemy back.

17:47.040 --> 17:48.630
The fight is not over.

18:22.760 --> 18:24.990
Danjo is making a lot of noise.

18:25.680 --> 18:28.990
It's distracting.

18:30.760 --> 18:33.590
This is terrible!

18:34.520 --> 18:36.640
Is Danjo okay?

18:37.280 --> 18:41.110
A bat must have scared him again.

18:41.600 --> 18:42.800
Look!

18:43.280 --> 18:45.000
Don't tell me... an ayakashi?

18:45.160 --> 18:49.040
But the barrier should have kept it out!

18:54.520 --> 18:58.800
Rasetsu will take care of Musashi.
I'll take care of the rest.

18:59.600 --> 19:02.990
The anti-ayakashi barrier is destroyed.

19:03.160 --> 19:05.520
It's an unexpected opportunity.

19:07.200 --> 19:11.670
For once, I'll take the artifact myself.

19:15.800 --> 19:17.470
Yin-Yang sword!

19:18.720 --> 19:20.040
Princess Kaguya!

19:20.480 --> 19:21.680
Take that!

19:24.080 --> 19:25.960
It went right through it!

19:28.840 --> 19:30.270
What's going on?

19:30.440 --> 19:33.830
It's as if it were an incorporeal ghost!

19:39.120 --> 19:40.950
It has turned into a ghost!

19:41.120 --> 19:43.480
Art of Metamorphosis?
A ninja?

19:47.080 --> 19:49.200
It turned into a ninja!

19:49.360 --> 19:50.920
What's going on?

19:51.080 --> 19:57.910
Maybe it turns into what
we are thinking about.

19:58.360 --> 19:59.870
Exactly.

20:00.280 --> 20:01.480
It is talking.

20:01.960 --> 20:04.110
- Who are you?
- Me?

20:04.600 --> 20:07.190
I am an ayakashi.

20:07.760 --> 20:11.750
So you are an ayakashi!
Another Yasha minion!

20:12.400 --> 20:14.600
Yasha?
Yasha?

20:15.240 --> 20:18.600
Do you know that bastard Yasha?

20:19.320 --> 20:21.040
Obviously!

20:21.200 --> 20:23.890
The renegade trying to
kidnap Princess Kaguya!

20:24.160 --> 20:25.750
You'll pay for this...

20:25.920 --> 20:28.070
Yasha, you'll pay for this!

20:29.480 --> 20:31.070
What do you mean?

20:31.240 --> 20:33.310
Isn't Yasha the leader of the ayakashi?

20:34.000 --> 20:36.670
Our leader?

20:37.640 --> 20:45.360
That guy exploited us
real ayakashi in the past...

20:45.520 --> 20:47.240
then he wiped us out!

20:47.680 --> 20:51.510
What?
He wiped out the real ayakashi?

20:53.280 --> 20:55.750
I will never forgive Yasha.

20:55.920 --> 20:57.480
Never...

20:58.320 --> 21:00.310
I hate him... I hate him...

21:00.480 --> 21:02.280
I hate Yasha!

21:02.920 --> 21:07.360
In the end, I don't mind
being hated so much.

21:08.560 --> 21:09.700
Yasha!

21:09.720 --> 21:12.390
You again! You've come to
kidnap Princess Kaguya!

21:14.400 --> 21:18.310
I'll protect the Princess Kaguya with my life!

21:18.960 --> 21:20.360
Don't worry.

21:20.840 --> 21:23.590
I am not here for the princess.

21:23.960 --> 21:25.280
For me, then?

21:25.440 --> 21:30.080
I'm getting the third
artifact hidden in this castle.

21:30.640 --> 21:33.520
We won't let the ayakashi
have any artifacts!

21:33.920 --> 21:39.030
That will be up to the one
who gets the artifact first.

21:45.840 --> 21:47.040
Hold that!

21:51.920 --> 21:54.150
Your opponent is me.

21:54.960 --> 21:56.160
Flammable bullet!

22:02.600 --> 22:03.920
It has no effect!

22:04.360 --> 22:07.190
Musashi, try the new bullets
Desperado gave you!

22:07.840 --> 22:09.670
I forgot about them!

22:10.320 --> 22:13.840
I don't know what you do,
but I'm counting on you!

22:19.120 --> 22:20.320
It worked!

22:23.520 --> 22:26.990
I'm on their side.

22:28.240 --> 22:30.120
Whatever you say.

22:30.280 --> 22:34.240
Whatever reinforcements you
have, you will not defeat me.

22:34.720 --> 22:37.920
- What confidence!
- Not really.

22:42.320 --> 22:44.230
It's been a long time, Yasha.

22:47.080 --> 22:48.280
You?

22:48.640 --> 22:50.600
The Urashima monk!

22:50.760 --> 22:52.990
You haven't forgotten me.

22:53.400 --> 22:56.200
- How could I?
- How surprising.

22:56.440 --> 22:58.590
What are you doing here?

22:58.760 --> 23:01.400
I've come to help the sorceress of the Moon.

23:02.320 --> 23:07.360
If I ally myself with them,
are you still so sure you'll win?

23:07.840 --> 23:09.040
We shall see!

23:09.800 --> 23:11.000
Urashima, watch out!

23:12.160 --> 23:13.800
It's useless, I am incorporeal.

23:14.440 --> 23:15.640
I see.

23:16.160 --> 23:18.990
I won't let the ayakashi have any artifacts.

23:19.640 --> 23:23.680
What can you do while incorporeal?

23:24.360 --> 23:27.720
The force of will does not require a body.

23:27.880 --> 23:29.680
It is even a hindrance.

23:39.280 --> 23:41.840
That's fine by me!

23:42.480 --> 23:45.790
I don't like easy fights.

23:46.720 --> 23:47.920
Yeah.

23:48.520 --> 23:49.720
Yeah.

23:50.880 --> 23:52.080
Yeah.

24:23.440 --> 24:25.190
MAKE HASTE

24:25.360 --> 24:27.160
THROUGH THE CROWDS

24:27.320 --> 24:31.080
THEY'RE CUTTING OFF YOUR ESCAPE

24:31.240 --> 24:34.950
IN THIS TWILIGHT TOWN
I HEAR PIERCING SOUNDS

24:35.120 --> 24:38.880
LIKE A WANDERING CAT

24:39.040 --> 24:40.790
WITHOUT KNOWING

24:40.960 --> 24:42.760
WHERE TO GO

24:42.920 --> 24:46.680
I'M TRAPPED IN THIS TOWN THAT NEVER SLEEPS

24:46.840 --> 24:50.360
MY REFLECTION IN THE MIRROR

24:50.520 --> 24:55.200
SEEING MYSELF TRANSFORM

24:55.360 --> 24:57.720
I'M HOLDING ON

24:57.880 --> 25:01.160
FOR AS LONG AS POSSIBLE

25:03.200 --> 25:07.830
I'LL SHOW YOU THAT I CAN

25:08.000 --> 25:10.560
WIN OVER THIS TOWN

25:11.720 --> 25:13.760
FROM MY BURNING HEART

25:13.920 --> 25:15.910
SHINE SO MANY

25:16.080 --> 25:19.870
DAZZLING COLORS AND LIGHTS

25:20.040 --> 25:21.550
FLOODING ALL OVER

25:21.720 --> 25:23.710
SCATTERING ALL OVER

25:27.200 --> 25:29.650
SOLEMNLY

25:30.520 --> 25:34.000
Once upon a time an artifact fell into a pond.

25:34.160 --> 25:37.950
The goddess of the pond picked it up,
divided it in two and sent it back.

25:38.120 --> 25:39.920
Is that the next chapter?

25:40.350 --> 25:41.690
No?

25:41.900 --> 25:44.650
The next chapter: <i>Pond and Limestone Cave</i>!
